<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae details terms of group split.</title>
<headline>Sonae details terms of group split.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sonae group, which plans to spin off its industrial activities from the start of 1997, said on Monday that shareholders would be entitled to one share in the new firm for every two held in Sonae Investimentos, the group holding.</p>
<p>The group said the new company, which still has no name, would be capitalised at 19.5 billion escudos.</p>
</text>
